              "file": "packages/zod/README.md",
              "span": {
                "from": 40,
                "to": 40
              },
              "role": "usage"
            }
          ],
          "note": "### Zod checks input against a declared schema\n\nAn application defines a shape for data, then parses an input value. The parsed result carries validated data or reports why the input failed. The schema also provides a TypeScript type.",
          "editor": {
            "primary": "packages/zod/README.md"
          }
        },
        {
